### Transfer - cuenta a cuenta(ADMIN-CUSTOMER_BASIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfer
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "description": "Pago de renta febrero",
  "currency": "MX",
  "sourceIdentifier": "ACC-1774713408076",
  "sourceIdentifierType": "ACCOUNT",
  "targetIdentifier": "ACC-1847392018473",
  "targetIdentifierType": "ACCOUNT"
}

### Purchase - card Liverpool(ADMIN-CUSTOMER_BASIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 349.99,
  "description": "Compra en Liverpool",
  "sourceAccountNumber": "ACC-1774713408076",
  "sourceCardNumber": "4111111111111111",
