### Withdrawal - ATM(ADMIN-CUSTOMER_BASIC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdrawal
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "description": "Retiro en cajero",
  "sourceAccountNumber": "ACC-1774713408076",
  "atmLocation": "Av. Insurgentes Sur 1234, CDMX",
